{"id":"9e7370aef3007b80","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-per-type-system.md","title":"PER type systems","display":"df-per-type-system — PER type systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-per-type-system","aliases":["72-df-per-type-system"],"display":"df-per-type-system — PER type systems","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, Summary of per semantics and Definition, printed p.748 / PDF p.760","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-per-type-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-per-type-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-per-type-system — PER type systems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, Summary of per semantics and Definition, printed p.748 / PDF p.760"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，以及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|E|\">\\(|E|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 遍历有序对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是集合论函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,s,t\\in T\">\\(a,b,s,t\\in T\\)</span>。下式引入类型系统谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、类型系统集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>、投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau,L_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau,L_\\tau\\)</span> 及类型相等、成员相等判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\tau\">\\(\\equiv_\\tau\\)</span>。投影及相等判断只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\tau(a)\">\\(L_\\tau(a)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|E_\\tau|\">\\(a\\in|E_\\tau|\\)</span> 时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists E\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\;\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)^{|E|}\\;\n\\left(\\tau=\\langle E,L\\rangle\\land\\forall a,b\\in|E|\\;(aEb\\Rightarrow L(a)=L(b))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists E\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\;\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)^{|E|}\\;\n\\left(\\tau=\\langle E,L\\rangle\\land\\forall a,b\\in|E|\\;(aEb\\Rightarrow L(a)=L(b))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle E,L\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P(T\\times\\mathcal P(T^2)):\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\langle E,L\\rangle)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle E,L\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P(T\\times\\mathcal P(T^2)):\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\langle E,L\\rangle)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_0(\\tau),\\qquad L_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_1(\\tau)\\quad(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_0(\\tau),\\qquad L_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_1(\\tau)\\quad(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\equiv_\\tau b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ aE_\\tau b,\\qquad\ns\\equiv_\\tau t:a\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle s,t\\rangle\\in L_\\tau(a)\\quad(a\\in|E_\\tau|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\equiv_\\tau b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ aE_\\tau b,\\qquad\ns\\equiv_\\tau t:a\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle s,t\\rangle\\in L_\\tau(a)\\quad(a\\in|E_\\tau|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书把L写成定义在类型相等商集上的函数。本节点将它拉回支撑，并显式要求aEb蕴涵L(a)=L(b)，所以两种呈现等价；不可漏掉这一条件。类型相等E与某类型内部的成员相等L(a)是不同层次，也不把二者都当成原始句法相等。TS是集合：E取自P(T²)，L的函数图取自P(T×P(T²))，不涉及对真类量化。未加入“成员PER相同则类型相同”的外延性假设，因原书随后也允许内涵类型相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，以及 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]] 的 $|E|$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，以及 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]] 的 $|E|$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"|E|","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau,L_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\tau(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in|E_\\tau|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists E\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\;\\exists L\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)^{|E|}\\;\n\\left(\\tau=\\langle E,L\\rangle\\land\\forall a,b\\in|E|\\;(aEb\\Rightarrow L(a)=L(b))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle E,L\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P(T\\times\\mathcal P(T^2)):\\operatorname{PTS}_{\\mathfrak e}(\\langle E,L\\rangle)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_0(\\tau),\\qquad L_\\tau\\coloneqq\\pi_1(\\tau)\\quad(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\equiv_\\tau b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ aE_\\tau b,\\qquad\ns\\equiv_\\tau t:a\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle s,t\\rangle\\in L_\\tau(a)\\quad(a\\in|E_\\tau|).","display":true}],"bytes":2640,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-per-type-system|df-per-type-system — PER type systems]]"},{"id":"986fa2bc3322b549","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-per-type-system]] 的 $\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$、$E_\\tau,L_\\tau$ 与 $|E_\\tau|$；$\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$，$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$。函数按其有序对图表示。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-per-type-system]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-per-type-system|df-per-type-system — PER type systems]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-per-type-system]]"}],"outgoing":["d79ea25f75d5218c","855f0d0656844c14"]}